{"ref":"BDB, עָפְרָה","hw":"עָפְרָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">עָפְרָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.</strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <strong>loc.</strong>: <strong>a.</strong>  in Benj. <a data-ref=\"Joshua 18:23\" href=\"/Joshua.18.23\">Jos 18:23</a> (P), Αφαρ, etc.; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:17\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.17\">1 S 13:17</a> Γοφερα; prob. = <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶפְרוֹן</span> <strong>2</strong> and <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶפְרַיִם</span> <strong>6</strong>; perhaps mod. <em>eṭ-Ṭayyibeh</em>, c. 4 miles NE. from Bethel, cf. GASm<sup>Geogr. 252</sup> Buhl<sup>Geogr. 177</sup>. <strong>b.</strong>  in Manasseh, Εφραθα: <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:11\" href=\"/Judges.6.11\">Ju 6:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:27\" href=\"/Judges.8.27\">8:27</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָפְרַת אֲבִי הָעֶזְרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:24\" href=\"/Judges.6.24\">6:24</a>, but <span dir=\"rtl\">עָפְרָה וגו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:32\" href=\"/Judges.8.32\">8:32</a>; c. ה loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">עָפְרָ֫תָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 9:5\" href=\"/Judges.9.5\">Ju 9:5</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong>n.pr.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.14\">1 Ch 4:14</a>, Γοφερα, 𝔊L Εφραθ.","next":"BDB, עֶפְרוֹן","prev":"BDB, עַפְרָה"}